[size=5][b]REARMED[/b][/size]
[size=3]Every gun gets a second trigger.[/size]

REARMED is a free mod for [b]Quake III Arena[/b] built on ioquake3. It adds alt-fire to every weapon, modern movement, the Team Arena weapons, gore and physics, bots that use all of it, and [b]DESCENT[/b]: a roguelike run through four acts of floors with bosses, loot and weapon evolutions.

[b]This is a beta.[/b] Bug reports, log files and opinions are very welcome in the Posts and Bugs tabs.

[size=4][b]Features[/b][/size]
[list]
[*][b]Alt-fire on every weapon[/b]: sticky grenades, remote-detonated rockets, chain lightning, ricochet rails, a plasma whirlpool, a triple BFG.
[*][b]Movement[/b]: double jump, wall jump, wall run, dash, slide, ground pound, offhand grapple and a zip line.
[*][b]Team Arena weapons[/b]: nailgun, chaingun and prox launcher, taken from your own Team Arena install.
[*][b]Hit feel[/b]: headshots, dismemberment, wall splats, physics props, a kill cam and a style meter.
[*][b]Bots that keep up[/b]: they flank, dodge rockets and rails, rocket-jump, time the big items and hunt you by sound.
[*][b]Game modes[/b]: Normal, Gun Game, Juggernaut, Instagib, One in the Chamber.
[*][b]Widescreen done right[/b]: Hor+ field of view, an ultrawide HUD, modern effects.
[/list]

[size=4][b]DESCENT[/b][/size]
[list]
[*]Four acts of six floors, each ending in a boss: The Butcher, The Overseer, The Hollow King and The Arch-Demon.
[*]Weapon levels and evolutions, chests, cards, ten skill trees and characters to unlock.
[*]Nine enemy types, elite affixes, champion packs and a nemesis that levels up when it kills you.
[*]Secret vaults with four bonus modes: gem rain, shooting gallery, rush and sky vault.
[*]A Daily Challenge with a personal best table, and boss practice with harder rematches.
[/list]

[size=4][b]Requirements[/b][/size]
[list]
[*]Your own copy of [b]Quake III Arena[/b] (Steam or GOG). Team Arena, which comes with both, is used for three weapons if you have it.
[*]Windows 10 or 11 and a graphics card with OpenGL 3.
[/list]
REARMED ships no id Software files. The first start finds your Quake III install and reads the game data from it, without changing anything there.

[size=4][b]Install[/b][/size]
[list=1]
[*]Unzip the folder anywhere.
[*]Run [b]Play REARMED.bat[/b].
[*]Press [b]F10[/b] in game (or Main menu > REARMED) for the settings. Every feature has its own switch.
[/list]
DESCENT is in the main menu.

[size=4][b]New controls[/b][/size]
[list]
[*]Right mouse: alt-fire (hold to charge)
[*]Q or Shift: dash
[*]E (hold): offhand grapple
[*]Z: zip line (aim at a wall)
[*]C while running: slide. C in the air: ground pound
[*]R (hold): weapon wheel
[*]F / G / V: nailgun / prox launcher / chaingun
[/list]
Everything can be rebound in Setup > Controls.

[size=4][b]Reporting a bug[/b][/size]
Please attach [b]home\rearmed\games.log[/b] and [b]home\rearmed\qconsole.log[/b] from the REARMED folder, plus your Windows version, graphics card and screen resolution. TESTERS.txt in the download explains what helps most.

[size=4][b]Source[/b][/size]
REARMED is GPL, like Quake III's game code and ioquake3. The full source and build steps are on GitHub: [url=https://github.com/lokki007/rearmed]github.com/lokki007/rearmed[/url]

[size=4][b]Support[/b][/size]
REARMED is free and stays free. If you enjoy it and want to say thanks, there's a tip jar: [url=https://xt3.gumroad.com/l/rearmed]Support REARMED on Gumroad[/url]. Endorsing the mod here helps too.
